WEBVTT

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:37.850
Can that really be?!

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:40.080
With a familiar figure
following behind us...

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:43.260
...we move out into the
desert to find waiting for us...

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:45.020
Hold it! Someone
named Valgaav...

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.560
...a servant of Gaav,
the Demon Dragon King?!

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.830
Before his powerful attack spells...

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.590
...we suddenly find
ourselves in a major pinch!

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:52.970
Hold it!
Just what's going on here?!

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:56.400
Quit hiding and start
explaining, Xellos!

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:16.220
It isn't going to hold!

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:19.660
First Xellos shows up, and now THIS!
What's going on here?!

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.090
And why's this happening to
us here in the outer world?!

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:30.370
How pathetic! Is this all you're
capable of, Lina Inverse?!

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:38.340
Miss Lina!

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:58.130
Don't disappoint me.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:01.300
You have more tricks up
your sleeve, don't you?

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:08.810
I see. You've inherited Gaav's
love for battle, haven't you?

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.740
Well, I think it may be boasting
to say you're Gaav's equal...

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:14.720
...but it definitely looks
like you're pretty powerful.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.520
If you understand that,
then start fighting seriously.

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:20.650
It's the least you
can do for someone...

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:23.320
...who's traveled all this
way just to kill you, right?

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:24.820
How about you?

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:28.230
It's only polite not to treat an enemy
you're facing for the first time...

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.490
...like they're just
useless cannon fodder.

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:34.570
Unfortunately, my nature won't
let me be that generous.

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:39.010
Not as long as you speak
so insultingly to me!

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:41.270
Lina!

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:45.880
You understand, don't you?
I will show you no mercy!

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.440
No kidding. What do I do?

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:51.920
If I take him on toe to toe,
I can only use the Ragna Blade!

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:54.190
You have no time
to think this over!

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:55.460
Lina!

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:06.370
Gorun Nova?!

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:07.200
What?

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:11.540
Gorun Nova? Isn't that what
Gaav called the Sword of Light?

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:25.880
Ragud Mezegis is reacting.
Gorun Nova?

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:32.060
What are you doing, Valgaav?
Hurry up and take it!

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:35.860
I know!

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.390
Don't be so eager...

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:42.330
Come on. Give that to me!

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:47.670
You damn thief!

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:50.640
I beg your pardon!
I just want it BACK!

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:51.820
What?!

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.020
Take this!

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:57.580
Bom Di Wind!

00:04:59.060 --> 00:04:59.750
What?

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:11.700
I've finally
found you, Valgaav.

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:12.900
Xellos...

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.140
Xellos?!

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:35.520
Elmekia Lance!

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.520
Don't count me out yet!

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:43.790
If you're thinking
I'm at a disadvantage...

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.040
...then you're DEAD wrong!

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:48.600
Well, now.
You seem to be angry!

00:05:56.810 --> 00:06:02.150
Working together, eh?
That isn't very fair of you.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:06.490
Don't tell me you want to
fight one on one now!

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:09.360
Gaav took us on in
this same set-up!

00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:13.360
Are you bluffing when you say
you're as powerful as Gaav was?

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:14.960
I see!

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:19.660
You want me to prove that I am
by taking you all on at once?

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.100
What a transparent proposal...

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:25.000
Sounds fun!

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:28.480
Let's try it!

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:32.010
Let's try it!

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:34.280
What the?!

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.710
Now what's happening?!

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:41.220
Wh- What's going on?!

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:06.910
They disappeared...

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:15.390
Dammit! We almost had it out!
What is this thing?!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.120
Uh, Boss?

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:20.850
It stopped?

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:21.900
It seems that way.

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:25.600
Whoops!

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:29.600
Oh, my! How sad!
How very sad!

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:32.940
Looks like he managed to
stay one step ahead of me.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:36.040
It seems he'll be a difficult
opponent to deal with.

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:39.880
Oh? Hello, my friends!
Fancy meeting you all here!

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:41.940
What an unexpected pleasure!

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:46.620
Xellos! Wow, no kidding!
Must be fate!

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:49.660
WHAT DO YOU THI NK
YOU'RE TALKI NG ABOUT?!

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:51.250
You crazy priest!

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:55.530
How many times will you use
us before you're satisfied?!

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.530
Ow, ow, ow...

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.730
Oh? You've figured that out?

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.660
Of course I have!

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:05.170
Just like you were after Gaav,
a traitor to the Monster race...

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:08.140
...you're after Valgaav,
his remaining minion, too!

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:09.280
I'm right, aren't I?!

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:15.750
Yes. And, on the other hand,
so he can avenge his master...

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:19.490
...Valgaav is after you,
the one who killed Gaav.

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:21.750
So, you used Miss Lina as bait...

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:25.520
...to make it easier to
lure him out and attack.

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.760
That's a sick little love triangle.

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:32.100
But I wasn't able to
catch him in the end.

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.190
Valgaav suddenly gained
a lot of power recently...

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:38.300
...and it's been impossible for the
Monster race to keep up with him.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:42.570
So... You're implying he's got
someone powerful backing him now.

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:45.010
Well, who can say?

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:49.340
What we know for sure is that
we have a nasty new enemy.

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:52.150
I guess this has to do with
the threat to the world...

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:53.880
...that Miss Filia
mentioned, doesn't it?

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:56.580
By the way, where'd Filia go?

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:01.490
I forgot all about her!

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:02.530
Filia?

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:07.570
- Filia! Miss Filia!
- Where are you? Filia?

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:08.400
Filia!

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:10.530
Answer us!

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:15.340
L- Lord Valgaav,
it's true, I tell you!

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:18.480
When the boss tried
to draw the sword!

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:20.570
It stopped when he let go.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:24.580
This thing?

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:32.560
Some sort of magical ward?
I see... We can use this.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.360
All right, Gravos.
If we draw this sword...

00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:40.130
...they'll end up coming near
this cave. Wait for my signal.

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.140
Huh? But, sir!

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:44.530
All you have to do
is do what I say!

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:46.500
Lord Valgaav?!

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:52.050
Ah... You're going to use
Ragud Mezegis, are you?

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:56.580
Yes. An annoying Monster's
shown up on my trail.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:10:00.320
Hmpf! That troublesome pest.
Well, no matter.

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:03.520
I'll give you one warning.

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:06.690
Don't let your blade
cross with Gorun Nova's.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.890
Right. I won't.

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:11.530
Then take it.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:26.380
I'll make you pay, Xellos.
And you, Lina Inverse!

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:38.360
He doesn't know the true horror
of our weapons as I do.

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.900
Just follow my dance
as well as you can.

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:56.220
How cruel!
Miss Lina, how could you?!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.520
Not only do you abandon me...

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:02.820
...but now you bring this filthy
Monster into my presence!

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:05.090
Hey, I said I was sorry.

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:08.970
Anyway, maybe this was all just a
pretext for luring Valgaav out, but...

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:13.300
I guess this means you
ended up saving us again.

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:15.470
You don't have to
sound so sad about it.

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:16.870
Xellos!

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:20.470
The Dragon race's enemy during
the War of the Monsters' Fall...

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:22.980
The one who nearly
destroyed my people!

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:25.210
He's a demon among demons!

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.520
Oh? Am I really that bad?

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:32.190
Look, I found Miss Lina first!
I don't know what you're planning...

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:34.420
...but stop interfering!
Stay out of our way!

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:36.520
I'm not getting in your way.

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:41.060
Oh, I get it. It's okay for YOU to
get Lina out here on a pretext...

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:43.230
...but it's horrible
if I did it first?

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:45.830
Even if I did use a pretext...

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:49.000
...I'M trying to save the
world from a threat!

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:52.170
It isn't like the selfish
pretexts a Monster would use!

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:54.340
A pretext is a pretext, isn't it?

00:11:56.720 --> 00:12:00.170
You get the feeling those two
don't really like each other?

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:02.550
Well, one's a Monster and
the other serves the Gods...

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:03.950
...as a priestess of
the Fire Dragon King.

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:06.890
A grudge that's gone on since
the War of the Monsters' Fall.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:10.300
Look, look. Anyway,
can we all calm down here?

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.760
Let's sort out what
we've learned so far.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:17.860
Xellos, for once I want you
tell us EVERYTHI NG you know.

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:21.100
As far as I know, the
enemy has three objectives.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.070
Three?

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:25.640
First, as you
already know, your life!

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:27.840
To avenge Gaav.

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:30.510
He has no reason to hate us!

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:34.490
The next one is Gorun Nova,
which Gourry possesses.

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:36.550
In short, the Sword of Light!

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:40.490
Can I ask you something?
What do you mean "Gorun Nova"?

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:42.030
Is that your peoples' dialect?

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:47.400
Hm? Oh, no. You see, Gorun Nova
is the proper name for it.

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:48.760
From ancient times.

00:12:49.070 --> 00:12:52.500
Now, hold on here! This has been
passed down through my family!

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:54.200
In other words, it's MI NE!

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:55.760
That's not the problem here!

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:59.640
Never mind! Never mind!
I recognize your ownership of it.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.940
While it's to my
advantage, at least...

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:03.140
What are you
mumbling about?!

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:05.110
And? What's his last objective?

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:07.150
It seems he's
looking for a weapon...

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:10.980
...similar to the Sword of
Light, but more powerful.

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.050
Now that you mention it...

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:17.890
Remember those greedy people
we saw when we arrived?

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:20.130
They seemed to be really
busy looking for something.

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.530
You think they were
involved with this, too?

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:25.590
That's silly. Besides, if it
was true and they had a weapon...

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:29.510
...as strong as the Sword of Light,
they wouldn't have run away!

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:30.440
True...

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:34.310
But it's a fact that they're in
a frenzy to find something.

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:38.110
Currently, their eyes are on the Holy
Sword held by the Sand People.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:40.410
The Holy Sword of the Sand People?

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:43.550
Wait, how do you know that much?

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:47.460
Before I ran into you all, I saw
them attack a Sand People village.

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:49.590
I came to see this
for myself, after all.

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:52.690
So... What's happening
in the village now?

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:57.930
See?

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:02.530
Mr. Xellos! You mean you just
LET that village be attacked?

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:04.640
I don't believe it!

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:10.170
Well... If Valgaav isn't there,
it's none of my business, is it?

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:13.380
You sure know how to do
government work, don't you?

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:18.720
Anyway...

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:19.780
You're going?

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:20.620
Exactly!

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:24.050
I'll take the Sand People's
treasure for myself!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.930
What?! You're not going
to save them?!

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.060
Wait for me!

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:30.560
Miss Lina!

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.130
Pardon. Filia, was it?

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:34.970
So, how's the Fire Dragon
King these days?

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:38.200
Don't set one foot
inside this line!

00:14:38.280 --> 00:14:39.440
You cockroach!
You GARBAGE!

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:40.800
Garbage?

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:43.310
You come near us
and you'll be sorry!

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:46.240
Miss Lina-a-a-a!

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:50.220
Garbage?

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:56.060
Here they come!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.790
HERE THEY COME!

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:02.970
Here they come! Boss!
They're coming!

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:06.830
Do it!

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:10.040
Don't blame me
for what happens!

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:38.860
What?!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:04.730
So, the protector I've
heard so much about...

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:07.430
Yeah.
Just earning my pension.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:09.400
What is that?
What's that weird weapon?

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:11.330
Are you saying
you'd like to see it?

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:15.330
It can't be! It's a weapon
just like the Sword of Light?!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:16.340
Gourry!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.670
There's only one Sword
of Light in this world!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.480
And it belongs to my family!

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:27.480
In that case, care to test it?

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:33.550
What is that thing?!

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:36.520
We'll have to finish it off.

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:40.260
Look! I warned him, didn't I?!

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:42.260
What do you mean?

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:47.000
It was this thing! Pulling it out is
what summoned that monster!

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:48.700
What? Then!

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:49.640
Oh, I see!

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:50.740
Mr. Xellos!

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:52.570
It seems the Sand
Peoples' Holy Sword...

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:55.880
...was simply a key for
keeping that monster sealed.

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:57.670
Do something, please!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.780
Oh, no. If I go doing things
for my own reasons...

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:02.250
...Lord Beastmaster
will be angry with me.

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:04.150
Typically useless!

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:08.990
Look, I dunno
what's going on here...

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:10.390
We'd better use
this chance to run!

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:12.990
Come back!

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:16.570
Miss Filia!

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:19.730
You won't be forgetting
about me THIS time!

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:27.440
Well? Are you satisfied now?

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:30.080
You're pretty tough.
Does this mean...

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.980
...you've found
what you're looking for?

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:34.420
One of them, at least.

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:36.810
ONE of them?!
You mean there are others?!

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:38.750
Then let's stop playing around!

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:41.780
If we didn't,
where would the fun be?

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.420
Come on!

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:45.820
We have to get that sword
back where it belongs!

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:48.060
All right! Leave it to me!

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:50.000
So, where's it belong?

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:52.800
Inside that shrine
over there, I believe.

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:57.080
A- All the way over there?

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:58.700
How much do you weigh?

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.070
I was asking you seriously!

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:06.250
All right!

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:09.190
Direction, 30 degrees.
Firing angle, 20!

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:11.720
Um, Mr. Zelgadis?

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:13.420
Relax! Let's get going!

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:15.280
Bom Di Wind!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:29.400
Mr. Zelgadis...
You're so mean...

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:39.180
Seems to have worked.

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:40.410
So, where's Lina?

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:47.750
Whichever weapon
is stronger will win!

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:49.890
No! Don't let
him provoke you!

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:52.430
I'm already provoked!

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:01.400
Wha... What the?!

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:03.100
What is this?!

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:09.470
That's!

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.610
What's happening?!

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:35.800
Almayce...

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:37.310
Retreat.

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:41.240
Why? I'm so close
to finishing them off!

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.670
Why retreat?!

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:45.710
I said retreat.

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:50.780
Like we're gonna let
you do what YOU want?!

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:52.650
You're not getting away!

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:57.860
ELMEKIA FLAME!

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:00.700
RAH TI LT!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:13.910
Their magic
wasn't strong enough!

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.810
No, that's not right.

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:17.680
It's not that it
isn't strong enough.

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:22.150
It's meaningless to even try
using magic on one of his kind.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:25.160
What does he mean?

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:32.930
Damn it...
Mark my words, Lina Inverse!

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:35.460
I will kill you!

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:41.000
Impossible...
Who are these guys?!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:45.370
Looks like another
major battle has begun.

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:49.040
Is that... Is he the one who will
fill the world with darkness?

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:53.750
Apparently so.
Just as your prophecy says...

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:56.440
The threat to the world.

00:22:23.740 --> 00:22:25.800
Let's go to the temple
of the Fire Dragon King!

00:22:25.880 --> 00:22:29.280
Filia! Xellos! What is the
problem with you two?!

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:33.380
Next time: " A Wild Rumor?
You Can't Have Smoke Without Fire?"

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:36.450
You better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
